    "detailed_description": "Bonoru Adventures<br />\r\n<br />\r\nwelcome. Dear gamers<br />\r\nBonoru Adventures<br />\r\nBecome a &quot;bonoru&quot; (water deer) and complete your mission to reach the hidden destination.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features<br />\r\nGet hit by a car in the tutorial? bonoru (water deer) wakes up in a suspicious map<br />\r\nThrough dialogue during the game, you can learn why the elk is hated by the farmer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\ngameplay<br />\r\nDiscover hidden destinations while listening to exciting music and talking to NPCs.<br />\r\nAvoid enemies and reach the next stage by jumping and teleporting.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\noperation keys<br />\r\nThe game simply uses arrow keys and WASD as movement keys.<br />\r\nSpace key is jump key<br />\r\nEat 10 carrots and press the right mouse button to teleport.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTMI<br />\r\nAlthough it is a protected species worldwide, it is a harmful species in Korea.<br />\r\nThe story of Bonoru the water deer.<br />\r\nI tried it as a casual, death run, and platform game.<br />\r\nWhy are they hated, and why do they do what they do?<br />\r\nYou can learn it by talking to NPCs.<br />\r\nThere are also tricks for each stage.<br />\r\nPlay it and reach the correct destination.",
